<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Novartis registered shares.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,000.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	18.60 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.24 CHF		  GEARING	15.89 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	19.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,775.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
